          <p class="ml-7 mt-2 text-[#0A0A0A]/70">You'll understand the 6 punches, how they should feel in both attacks and defense, plus the rules that make them work in shadowboxing.</p>
        </li>

        <li>
          <p class="flex gap-3 font-bold text-[#0A0A0A]"><span class="text-[#D4A373] shrink-0">◆</span><span>3 Shadowboxing Mistakes That Kill Skill</span></p>
          <p class="ml-7 mt-2 text-[#0A0A0A]/70">Learn how to:</p>
          <ul class="ml-7 mt-2 flex flex-col gap-1.5 text-[#0A0A0A]/75 text-sm">
            <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-[#0A0A0A]/40 shrink-0">•</span>Set up attacks</li>
            <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-[#0A0A0A]/40 shrink-0">•</span>Exit (instead of freezing/getting hit)</li>
            <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-[#0A0A0A]/40 shrink-0">•</span>Move with purpose instead of bouncing or cool combinations</li>
